WEBVTT

00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:16,050
I currently put equal parts, Epsom salts, and filtered water into a spray bottle that spray

00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:22,530
it on my torso and legs after a sauna when my pores are open. Is this a good way to supplement

00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:32,610
magnesium or am I missing out on another vital form? Well, Epsom salts is a magnesium salt.

00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:45,020
Now, there has been other topical magnesium that we've used in the past. There's a magnesium oil

00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:48,620
that you could get as a spray. I think it's an olive oil or some base.

00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:57,980
And for that was really popular, and it's making it come back, sometimes these supplement things

00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:05,900
have trends and it's trending more. The magnesium oil is trending more. But it isn't magnesium salt

00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:12,620
that when it gets on your skin, do you absorb some? Yes, do you absorb some Epsom salts when you

00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:19,820
take an Epsom salt bath? Yes, you do. Do you absorb a lot? No, not really. You know, you don't

00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:28,140
really absorb a lot through your skin. The negative of the oils, or doing what you're doing,

00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:34,940
dissolving the salt in a water and spray it on, it can leave a salty residue on your skin.

00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:44,860
And you notice that, and especially with the oil, people used to notice like a white residue that

00:01:44,860 --> 00:01:51,180
was left. That's just the magnesium salt that's left. I really don't think you're absorbing a lot.

00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:57,580
Of course, you're not paying a lot for the Epsom salts filtered water. So I don't say negative to that.

00:01:58,140 --> 00:02:06,140
But the magnesium oils that are now making it come back trend-wise to use as a topical

00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:13,100
source of magnesium. For the cost of it, it just takes some magnesium. Magnesium is a fairly inexpensive

00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:20,460
supplement to take. Why try to absorb it through your skin when you could just, it absorbs quite

00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:29,020
well in your gut. So now I understand this is an expensive way to do it, but I think the oil is

00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:34,540
kind of silly. People who say, well, it's better because my child won't take a pill. Well, there's

00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:40,620
magnesium powders that are, you know, flavored with natural, you know, good, natural flavor.

00:02:41,260 --> 00:02:48,860
That is that kids will drink. I don't see really a benefit of the oil. I don't see a benefit

00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:56,540
of the topical. I just don't know how much a person is really absorbing. So I don't, I'm not a big fan

00:02:56,540 --> 00:02:57,260
of that.

